{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-a69b7016bd68f245ad508b6a6f299f2ed5c8102e0d4adbb5","family_id":"KR:006574","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Rules of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법 시행규칙","kind":"기획재정부령","source_version":"270243","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=270243","source_sha256":"99129fa87198dde7d65113cb7db1fbce6f402e0eebdd4849d79cfbe3f5e1d12e","body_sha256":"91bad05fcea16dc1fcf690e0328329cb006511377dc258c01e58a7d068133909","article_count":0,"full_text":"[Attached Form No. 14] <Amended on April 5, 2007>\n\n(Front)\n\nArticles for Purposes Exempt from Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax\n[ ] Application for Certification  [ ] Certificate\n\nProcessing period: 5 days.\n\nApplicant\n\n| ① Name (representative) | ② Resident (corporate) registration number |\n|---|---|\n| | |\n| ③ Business name (corporate name) | ④ Telephone number |\n| | |\n| ⑤ Address (location of head office) | |\n| | |\n\nDetails of Application\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>⑥ Name of tax-exempt article</th><th>⑦ Quantity</th><th>⑧ Specifications</th><th>⑨ Purpose of use</th><th>⑩ Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</table>\n\n⑪ Basis for exemption: Article ____, paragraph ____, subparagraph ____ of the Act.\n\nEnd User\n\n| ⑫ Name (representative) | ⑬ Resident (corporate) registration number |\n|---|---|\n| | |\n| ⑭ Business name (corporate name) | |\n| | |\n| ⑮ Address (location of head office) | |\n| | |\n| ⑯ Place of entry | ⑰ Business registration number |\n| | |\n\n⑱ Matters for reference: __________________________________________________\n\nPlease certify pursuant to Article 22 (2) of the Enforcement Decree of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act that the above articles fall under [ ] Article 15 (1), subparagraph (____), or [ ] Article 16, subparagraph (____), of that Act.\n\nYear ____ Month ____ Day ____\nApplicant: ____________________ (Signature or seal)\n\nTo the Minister / Head of the Institution\n\nNo. ______\n\nI certify the facts stated above.\n\nYear ____ Month ____ Day ____\nMinister / Head of the Institution: ____________________ [Seal]\n\nTo: ____________________\n\nRequired documents: None.\n※ This application form is distributed free of charge.\nFee: None.\n\nGeneral paper, 60 g/m² (recycled), or newsprint, 54 g/m² (recycled)\n\n(Reverse)\n\nThis application is processed as follows.\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>Applicant</th><th>Processing authority: Head of the tax office having jurisdiction over the place of business</th></tr>\n<tr><td>1. Prepare application</td><td>2. Receive application (Civil Service Office)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>3. Investigate and verify (Competent institution)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>4. Decide</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>5. Prepare certificate</td></tr>\n</table>\n\nThe application proceeds from box 1 to box 2 on the right, then downward through boxes 3, 4, and 5. The final arrow from box 5 runs left and upward to the applicant and is labelled “Issue certificate.”\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\389efdda511138000ae8757dda9aa35320a03de9399e08064ec50cebd75f3b7c.ascii.json","sha256":"389efdda511138000ae8757dda9aa35320a03de9399e08064ec50cebd75f3b7c"},"protocol":"WORKC_P04_1526_EXPLICIT_SOURCE_REVIEWED_AUTHOR_INPUT_V1","reviewed_source_units":[{"source_component_text_sha256":"2fb7bd6f40dafc97c3fe591fd13656f131f2d10c77acbae7b6b54b31cab2dfd8","unit_key":"form-001200